# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>

# === Commit Message Convention ===
#
# Type (필수):
#   feat     : 새로운 기능 추가
#   fix      : 버그 수정
#   refactor : 리팩토링 (기능 변화 없음)
#   test     : 테스트 코드 추가/수정
#   chore    : 빌드/설정/환경 관련 변경
#   docs     : 문서 관련 변경
#   style    : 포맷팅, 들여쓰기 등 (기능 영향 없음)
#   perf     : 성능 개선
#
# Scope (필수):
#   backend, frontend, docs, docker, scripts, shared
#   backend:user, backend:board, backend:auth
#   frontend:components, frontend:pages, frontend:api
#   docs:architecture, docs:api
#
# Summary (필수):
#   - 명령형, 소문자 시작, 50자 이내
#   - 마침표 없음
#   - 예: "add user registration functionality"
#
# Body (선택):
#   - 72자마다 줄바꿈
#   - What과 Why 설명
#
# Footer (선택):
#   - Closes #123
#   - BREAKING CHANGE: 설명
#
# === 예시 ===
# feat(backend:user): add email verification system
# fix(frontend:board): resolve card drag and drop issue
# refactor(backend:domain): extract user validation logic
# test(backend:user): add user repository integration tests
# docs(architecture): update hexagonal architecture diagram
